  "notes": [
    "Armadura segmentada de hierro ennegrecido, tres marcas de marfil en las hombreras, cuello corto de piel clara y hebilla circular con huella de oso distinguen a esta evolucion pesada de Berserker. Cuero rojo oscuro remachado, rodilleras articuladas y botas de hierro; pelo gris masculino en capas y coleta alta trenzada femenina.",
    "All thirty original action strips and all selected revised whole poses were visually reviewed. Representative equipment of every type and both axe structures checked for both sexes, including actual palms, finger edges and final hilts/shafts. Both sexes have fifteen actions and 682 contacts without warnings.",
