    "Portrait derivations repeat the entire unchanged raw canvas before fixed canonical normalization and whole-pose selection. No body painting, limb transplants, per-class equipment offsets or per-pose export adjustments. Final composites confirm the walking fist and recovery grips, with legacy spear/cloth, wrist, fingertip and consumable waist-return contacts retained where the shared structure intentionally uses them. No automatic runtime promotion."
